# Containers & Layout

## Primary container

```tsx
// ✅ Site-wide content shell
<div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-6">{children}</div>
```

| Role | Classes |
|------|---------|
| Page / section shell | `max-w-7xl mx-auto` |
| Nav bar inner | `max-w-7xl mx-auto` + `h-16 lg:h-24` |
| Hero copy measure | `max-w-4xl` or `max-w-5xl` + `mx-auto` + `px-4 sm:px-6` |
| Narrow title stack | `max-w-3xl` |
| Mega menu panels | `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 lg:px-6 py-8` |

## Section rhythm

- Default content sections: `pt-8` / `pt-8 pb-6` / `py-8` + horizontal `px-4 sm:px-6`
- Alt background sections: `bg-surface-muted` (or `bg-[#f8f9fa]` only if matching Designs pixel-exact)
- CTA band (`#cta-section`): `py-6 px-6`, full-bleed `bg-teal`
- Footer: `pb-6 pt-8 px-6` inside `max-w-7xl`

## Radius

- CTAs / pills / nav buttons: `rounded-full`
- Cards / panels / mega links: `rounded-[4px]` (not `rounded-lg` / `rounded-xl` unless Designs use it)

## Sticky chrome

- Header: `sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white border-b border-gray-200`
- Solution / company subnav: `sticky top-16 lg:top-24 z-40`

## Component rule

Export a shared `Container` component for the `max-w-7xl` shell. Pages must not redefine custom max-widths that fight the design system.
